            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 59930,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esiste un modo semplice per scorrere tutti gli elementi di una lista usando un ciclo <code>for</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Four executions",
            "id": 59920,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per scorrere gli elementi nella lista <code>final_scores</code>, scriviamo <code>for</code>, una variabile come <code>score</code>, la parola <code>in</code> e la lista <code>final_scores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>score</code> e poi <code>in</code>, <code>final_scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per scorrere una lista, scrivi <code>for</code>, una variabile per l'elemento corrente, <code>in</code> e il nome della lista.</p><p>Scorri la lista in modo che ogni punteggio venga stampato su una riga separata: <code>17</code>, <code>22</code>, <code>34</code>, <code>13</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>score</code>, <code>in</code> e infine <code>final_scores</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Length",
            "id": 59924,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il ciclo verrà eseguito per tanti elementi quanti ce ne sono nell'elenco. Qui vedremo quattro elementi nella console scrivendo <code>print(score)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"74\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>print(score)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "for",
            "id": 59925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La variabile prima di <code>in</code> contiene il valore dell'elemento della lista su cui si trova attualmente il ciclo. Qui useremo <code>artist</code> come variabile.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"artists = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chagall&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lissitzky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(artist)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chagall\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lissitzky\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>artist</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La variabile prima di <code>in</code> contiene l'elemento della lista su cui si trova il ciclo. Scegli un nome adatto al corpo del ciclo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"artists = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chagall&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lissitzky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(artist)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"artists\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chagall\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lissitzky\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>artist</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 81305,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come eseguiamo un ciclo su una lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Con un ciclo for</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Con un'istruzione <code>print()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Con un ciclo for.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo un ciclo <code>for</code> per scorrere una lista.</p><p>La lista si chiama <code>cities</code>. Quale intestazione visita ogni valore usando la variabile <code>city</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for city in cities:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for cities in city:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(city in cities)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for city in cities:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 81306,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"student_grades = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" student_grades:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A-\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"C\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"A\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"A-\"</code> e infine da <code>\"C\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Questo codice non visualizzerà nulla nella console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"A\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"A-\"</code> e infine da <code>\"C\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se sostituisci <code>print(grade)</code> con <code>print(student_grades[1])</code>, che cosa visualizzerà il ciclo?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"student_grades = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;A&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" student_grades:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"A\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A-\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"C\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A- su tre righe separate</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A, poi A-, poi C su righe separate</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A- una sola volta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere A- su tre righe separate.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 81307,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa c'è che non va in questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"singers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bowie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Freddie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singers:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(singer)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La posizione di <code>in</code> e <code>for</code> è invertita</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è niente di sbagliato in questo codice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La posizione di <code>in</code> e <code>for</code> è invertita.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'intestazione di un ciclo su una lista contiene <code>for</code>, la variabile del ciclo, <code>in</code> e infine la lista.</p><p>Quale riga dovrebbe sostituire l'intestazione non valida?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"singers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bowie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Freddie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singers:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(singer)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for singer in singers:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for singers in singer:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in singer for singers:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for singer in singers:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 81308,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(console)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Xbox\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Playstation\"</code> e <code>\"Xbox\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non viene visualizzato nulla nella console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Playstation\"</code> e <code>\"Xbox\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se <code>\"Nintendo\"</code> viene aggiunto alla fine di <code>consoles</code> prima dell'esecuzione del ciclo, come cambia l'output?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(console)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Xbox\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Nintendo</code> appare su una nuova riga dopo <code>Xbox</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'output rimane invariato perché il ciclo può visitare soltanto due valori.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Nintendo</code> appare prima di <code>Playstation</code> perché i nuovi valori vengono visitati per primi.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Nintendo</code> appare su una nuova riga dopo <code>Xbox</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 81309,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un'istruzione <code>print()</code> all'interno del ciclo for e visualizza <code>item</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tomato&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(item)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items:\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tomato\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>item</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno del ciclo, la variabile <code>item</code> contiene un elemento alla volta.</p><p>Stampa ogni elemento in modo che la console mostri <code>milk</code>, <code>tomato</code> e <code>apple</code> su righe separate.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tomato&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(item)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tomato\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code>, <code>item</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
